1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:24,920
It was my fault.

2
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:27,840
I drove her to this.

3
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,220
That seems to be the case.

4
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:33,520
The hope you showed her caused her to fall into despair.

5
00:00:34,020 --> 00:00:37,500
Because of that, her time as a magical girl came to its proper end.

6
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:39,120
You sound happy.

7
00:00:39,920 --> 00:00:41,600
Well, what happened isn't tragic.

8
00:00:42,440 --> 00:00:44,880
Your hope and the despair that eventually follows

9
00:00:44,880 --> 00:00:48,040
is what allow us to extend the lifespan of the universe.

10
00:00:48,620 --> 00:00:49,840
Thanks to your sac-

11
00:00:49,840 --> 00:00:53,500
That's all we're good for?

12
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,760
Aren't magical girls supposed to save people?

13
00:00:55,760 --> 00:00:59,300
What's the point of having powers if we can't save anyone with them?

14
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:06,500
Why couldn't I save Kuroi and Ui?

15
00:01:07,480 --> 00:01:08,040
Why?

16
00:01:08,040 --> 00:01:12,480
You know why you couldn't.

17
00:01:15,600 --> 00:01:18,940
You pretended to understand them, but you didn't know a thing.

18
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:23,260
Even if you did, you can't actually do anything to help.

19
00:01:23,900 --> 00:01:26,320
You just lie to yourself and think you know.

20
00:01:26,860 --> 00:01:27,880
No, you're lying.

21
00:01:27,880 --> 00:01:32,000
How many magical girls do you think are going to become witches now?

22
00:01:32,480 --> 00:01:32,800
Huh?

23
00:01:33,660 --> 00:01:36,740
How many magical girls do you think will become witches

24
00:01:36,740 --> 00:01:39,520
now that you stopped the Magius' plan?

25
00:01:41,620 --> 00:01:43,260
You're saying...

26
00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:44,540
I'm responsible?

27
00:01:46,220 --> 00:01:47,720
It's my fault?

28
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:48,960
See?

29
00:01:49,420 --> 00:01:50,760
You don't know a thing.

30
00:01:50,760 --> 00:02:00,020
Iroha!

31
00:02:00,020 --> 00:02:00,320
Iroha!

32
00:02:02,980 --> 00:02:03,580
Iroha!

33
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:04,620
Can you hear me?

34
00:02:06,820 --> 00:02:08,620
I'm sorry, Yachiyo.

35
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:12,720
But I shouldn't have ever become a magical girl.

36
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:14,200
You're spacing out, Iroha!

37
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:15,500
Snap out of it!

38
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:19,680
We'll be up in a sec, so hang in there!

39
00:02:19,780 --> 00:02:21,200
We're not giving up on you!

40
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,580
Talk to us, Iroha!

41
00:02:22,900 --> 00:02:23,540
Say something!

42
00:02:25,120 --> 00:02:27,640
I know you're in pain and feeling like you failed,

43
00:02:27,740 --> 00:02:28,940
but don't keep it to yourself!

44
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:30,080
Share it with us!

45
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:43,580
Hey, you guys!

46
00:02:43,580 --> 00:02:45,520
Now that we're all together,

47
00:02:45,980 --> 00:02:47,820
let's combine our hope and despair!

48
00:02:48,640 --> 00:02:50,860
The hatred we're never ever gonna forget!

49
00:02:51,380 --> 00:02:53,360
The loneliness from being alone!

50
00:02:54,020 --> 00:02:55,400
Our fear and anxiety!

51
00:02:56,440 --> 00:02:58,160
Past selves we can't forgive!

52
00:03:02,260 --> 00:03:04,580
Our failures that we can't undo!

53
00:03:05,700 --> 00:03:07,720
All that and our hope, too!

54
00:03:07,720 --> 00:03:21,620
Thank you for coming to my rescue!

55
00:03:22,140 --> 00:03:23,740
You don't have to thank us, Iroha!

56
00:03:24,100 --> 00:03:26,060
It's because of you that we made it this far!

57
00:03:26,060 --> 00:03:32,260
Hey, um, where are Toka and Nemu?

58
00:03:32,380 --> 00:03:35,300
They're using Embryo Eve to go after Valpurgisnacht.

59
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:36,680
If we don't stop them,

60
00:03:36,940 --> 00:03:39,540
the shockwave after they fuse with it will destroy the city!

61
00:03:40,580 --> 00:03:41,720
I warned you!

62
00:03:42,300 --> 00:03:43,200
Now that you know,

63
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:45,660
you'll have to choose who you're going to save!

64
00:03:46,220 --> 00:03:47,420
Yeah, I know that!

65
00:03:47,420 --> 00:03:51,840
Well, are we ready to fail again?

66
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:56,600
No matter how many times I fail,

67
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:59,740
the piece of me who lives in my friends from Mikazuki Villa

68
00:03:59,740 --> 00:04:01,180
will help me remember hope!

69
00:04:01,820 --> 00:04:03,180
You're part of me, too.

70
00:04:03,440 --> 00:04:04,560
And even if you give up,

71
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:07,040
that piece of me inside everyone else

72
00:04:07,040 --> 00:04:08,540
will always reach out to me!

73
00:04:08,540 --> 00:04:13,040
I didn't know anything about you, Kuroi.

74
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:15,220
Please forgive me.

75
00:04:17,160 --> 00:04:18,060
Hey, everyone!

76
00:04:18,360 --> 00:04:19,180
Lend me your power!

77
00:04:19,480 --> 00:04:21,520
I'm gonna need it to stop Toka and Nemu!

78
00:04:21,980 --> 00:04:24,160
I can't let them sacrifice themselves!

79
00:04:24,700 --> 00:04:26,320
Those two are like my little sisters!

80
00:04:34,380 --> 00:04:35,500
We're in time.

81
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:36,680
There she is.

82
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:38,820
While Pergus knocked.

83
00:04:46,840 --> 00:04:48,300
Just as we calculated.

84
00:04:49,020 --> 00:04:49,360
Yep.

85
00:04:49,640 --> 00:04:52,220
It won't be long till she's right on top of Mitakihara.

86
00:04:53,640 --> 00:04:55,000
Let's keep those two busy

87
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,220
until the other magical girls can catch up with us!

88
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:00,920
If we're crying out loud, it's her again!

89
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:25,260
Did you see that, Kaide?

90
00:05:25,520 --> 00:05:27,520
We'll be just fine on our own now.

91
00:05:28,020 --> 00:05:30,500
Would Momoko be proud of us if she were here?

92
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:31,980
Yeah, of course she'd be!

93
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:34,920
I bet you'd say we're strong enough now to do anything!

94
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:41,240
Those chains won't hold Embryo E for long!

95
00:05:41,400 --> 00:05:43,040
Get ready to focus your attacks!

96
00:05:43,040 --> 00:06:04,780
Dealing with kids is such a drag!

97
00:06:04,780 --> 00:06:22,060
Could all of you please think rationally?

98
00:06:22,540 --> 00:06:25,180
The big magical girls we're stuck with isn't there,

99
00:06:25,320 --> 00:06:28,280
and our plan is the quickest and best way to free us from it!

100
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:29,400
But it's not right!

101
00:06:36,740 --> 00:06:39,540
Toka and Nemu, you have to stop this right now!

102
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,680
W-what are you doing here?

103
00:06:42,140 --> 00:06:43,540
We sealed you away.

104
00:06:43,540 --> 00:06:45,820
I saw Ui, and she let me out!

105
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:49,340
Even she knows that doing things this way won't save anyone!

106
00:06:53,340 --> 00:06:55,220
You have nothing to worry about.

107
00:06:55,360 --> 00:06:58,420
If there are any casualties, it won't be anybody you know.

108
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,200
And if anyone should die,

109
00:07:00,340 --> 00:07:03,420
we're the ones who'd be responsible for killing them, not you.

110
00:07:03,620 --> 00:07:05,320
You have nothing to do with it.

111
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,980
How can you say stuff like that?

112
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:08,620
I feel responsible for you!

113
00:07:08,700 --> 00:07:09,580
You're like my sisters!

114
00:07:09,580 --> 00:07:14,200
And you know me and Ui well enough to know we'd never be okay with this!

115
00:07:17,500 --> 00:07:21,740
I know you always make other people the priority instead of yourself,

116
00:07:21,940 --> 00:07:24,020
but you should care about yourself more.

117
00:07:24,140 --> 00:07:26,000
I can say the same about you guys.

118
00:07:26,280 --> 00:07:28,640
You cared about Ui and me, and look what happened.

119
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:30,300
This is my fault.

120
00:07:30,640 --> 00:07:31,280
All of this.

121
00:07:31,700 --> 00:07:32,820
If it wasn't for me,

122
00:07:32,920 --> 00:07:35,580
you wouldn't have become magical girls in the first place.

123
00:07:35,780 --> 00:07:37,280
What a stupid thing to say!

124
00:07:37,460 --> 00:07:38,280
You big dummy!

125
00:07:38,280 --> 00:07:39,900
Who cares whose fault it was?

126
00:07:40,120 --> 00:07:43,400
You staying alive and having more time to spend with us is all we wanted!

127
00:07:44,360 --> 00:07:46,240
Having more time to spend together

128
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:48,920
would have made us all a lot happier, wouldn't it?

129
00:07:49,380 --> 00:07:52,260
Well, it's a lot better than having less time.

130
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,140
You know, you're right.

131
00:07:54,360 --> 00:07:55,580
It is a lot better.

132
00:07:55,760 --> 00:07:57,500
So why don't you stay with me now?

133
00:07:58,080 --> 00:08:00,240
Stay with me every second you can.

134
00:08:00,940 --> 00:08:02,200
None of this other stuff,

135
00:08:02,540 --> 00:08:04,260
saving magical girls or whatever,

136
00:08:04,780 --> 00:08:06,900
none of it would matter if I didn't have you.

137
00:08:06,900 --> 00:08:08,800
I couldn't bear it

138
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:10,860
if you just disappeared out of my life again.

139
00:08:11,320 --> 00:08:13,120
Don't leave me alone like that.

140
00:08:15,440 --> 00:08:16,920
Come on, stay with me.

141
00:08:17,060 --> 00:08:18,920
Don't go leaving your big sis alone.

142
00:08:20,940 --> 00:08:22,080
Please don't cry.

143
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,220
Yes, top it.

144
00:08:25,220 --> 00:08:26,640
I will.

145
00:08:27,180 --> 00:08:29,000
As long as you let me love you

146
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:30,920
with whatever time I have left.

147
00:08:30,920 --> 00:08:41,960
That's so not fair!

148
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:43,180
How could you say that?

149
00:08:43,260 --> 00:08:45,720
It's like you think I don't want to be around you or something,

150
00:08:45,820 --> 00:08:47,020
which is totally wrong!

151
00:08:47,180 --> 00:08:48,300
You think I don't love you?

152
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:48,860
Is that it?

153
00:08:48,920 --> 00:08:50,020
How could you think that?

154
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,680
You're like the biggest, dumbest dummy in the world!

155
00:08:52,680 --> 00:08:57,060
We worked so hard to forget those happy times.

156
00:08:58,100 --> 00:08:59,400
And here you are,

157
00:08:59,760 --> 00:09:01,180
making us remember again.

158
00:09:05,140 --> 00:09:06,220
It's okay.

159
00:09:06,700 --> 00:09:07,780
It's okay.

160
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,960
Don't ever leave us, ever.

161
00:09:13,100 --> 00:09:14,060
I'm sorry.

162
00:09:14,740 --> 00:09:15,800
I'm so sorry.

163
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:18,080
There, there, it's okay.

164
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:20,820
Nothing's gonna come between us ever again.

165
00:09:20,940 --> 00:09:21,720
I promise.

166
00:09:33,060 --> 00:09:33,700
Incoming!

167
00:09:39,420 --> 00:09:40,380
Ciao, ciao!

168
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:43,000
How are all you goody-goody girls doing today?

169
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,140
It's Alina Kray.

170
00:09:44,420 --> 00:09:46,440
Now don't you worry, Toka and Nemo.

171
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:51,000
The poor Rivoluzione you and your little feathers tried to make isn't done.

172
00:09:51,360 --> 00:09:54,360
It just needs Alina's touch to completare it.

173
00:09:54,660 --> 00:09:58,040
Yeah, about that, the plan's sort of changed now.

174
00:09:58,740 --> 00:10:00,800
I have grande respeto for you both,

175
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:04,080
and your arte emotiva inspired me to create something.

176
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:08,340
I'll turn all humanity into magical girls.

177
00:10:11,020 --> 00:10:13,960
Whatever game you think you're playing, you better stop.

178
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:16,520
First, I'll fuse my Doppel with Embryo E.

179
00:10:16,680 --> 00:10:18,900
Then steal all Pergusnot's power.

180
00:10:19,040 --> 00:10:22,600
And then, I'll force my new Doppel onto every human on the planet.

181
00:10:23,180 --> 00:10:25,060
They'll all have magic powers like us,

182
00:10:25,140 --> 00:10:26,560
but without any grief seeds.

183
00:10:27,020 --> 00:10:29,360
Their Doppels will take them over one by one

184
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:31,380
until they've all been turned into witches.

185
00:10:31,380 --> 00:10:33,360
Do you get it?

186
00:10:33,780 --> 00:10:35,480
They'll share the same fate as us.

187
00:10:35,840 --> 00:10:36,840
It's brillante!

188
00:10:37,100 --> 00:10:37,940
That's stupid!

189
00:10:38,100 --> 00:10:40,800
The whole point of our plan was to liberate magical girls,

190
00:10:40,940 --> 00:10:42,300
but you want to go and make more?

191
00:10:42,480 --> 00:10:46,220
You do realize this plan of yours won't be saving anyone, right?

192
00:10:46,220 --> 00:10:51,640
My latest work will show the world

193
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:54,480
that magical girls are real and really angry.

194
00:10:55,060 --> 00:10:56,900
Liberating magical girls is fine,

195
00:10:57,020 --> 00:10:59,200
but my show will be itchitante!

196
00:10:59,500 --> 00:11:01,900
We were trying to save us, not put on a show!

197
00:11:02,060 --> 00:11:03,060
In a few moments,

198
00:11:03,280 --> 00:11:05,020
the story that is Alina Gray

199
00:11:05,020 --> 00:11:07,740
will scop the air into a flame of creativity!

200
00:11:08,560 --> 00:11:11,700
Alina will make everything into arte so gorgeous,

201
00:11:11,700 --> 00:11:13,320
you'll all thank me for it!

202
00:11:16,880 --> 00:11:18,360
Ciao, goody-goodies!

203
00:11:18,620 --> 00:11:19,900
Ciao, Mophis!

204
00:11:20,920 --> 00:11:22,620
Ciao, Alina Gray!

205
00:11:41,700 --> 00:11:42,220
Stop her!

206
00:11:42,540 --> 00:11:43,420
Don't let her go!

207
00:11:49,420 --> 00:11:51,380
Alina's going after Valpurgisnacht!

208
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:55,320
Nemo,

209
00:11:55,520 --> 00:11:57,400
we have to finish the plan.

210
00:11:57,960 --> 00:11:59,540
Yes, Toka, let's complete it.

211
00:11:59,760 --> 00:12:02,020
We just have one last sacrifice to make

212
00:12:02,020 --> 00:12:03,000
and this will be over.

213
00:12:03,380 --> 00:12:04,020
Ah!

214
00:12:07,300 --> 00:12:10,900
No matter how many unforgivable things we've done,

215
00:12:10,900 --> 00:12:14,020
becoming magical girls to protect our big sis

216
00:12:14,020 --> 00:12:16,440
is the one thing we won't ever regret.

217
00:12:16,900 --> 00:12:18,820
It was the right thing to do.

218
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:22,560
Big sis, go live a wrong life and be happy.

219
00:12:23,180 --> 00:12:25,520
Live well for us and for Ui.

220
00:12:26,500 --> 00:12:28,420
Toka, Nemo, don't do that!

221
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:42,360
Thanks for coming to help, Ui!

222
00:12:43,020 --> 00:12:45,400
Together to the end, as we plan.

223
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:47,400
What is this?

224
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:48,520
Did I die?

225
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:51,400
What is this?

226
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:53,400
Did I die?

227
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:57,640
Mel and Kanai, I guess I did die.

228
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:59,400
No, we're not ghosts.

229
00:12:59,400 --> 00:13:00,400
What is this?

230
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:01,400
Did I die?

231
00:13:01,400 --> 00:13:07,400
Mel and Kanai, I guess I did die.

232
00:13:07,400 --> 00:13:08,400
No, we're not ghosts.

233
00:13:08,400 --> 00:13:10,640
I'm the magic I used to have before I died.

234
00:13:10,640 --> 00:13:13,400
I've been a part of you since then.

235
00:13:13,400 --> 00:13:16,400
I had no idea that when any of my friends died,

236
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:20,400
I had the power to collect their magic like some kind of prize.

237
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:21,400
What a disgusting ability.

238
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:22,400
I'm so sorry.

239
00:13:22,400 --> 00:13:23,400
You don't have to be sorry about a thing.

240
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:24,400
It's not about collecting magic like you're gobbling up more power for yourself or something.

241
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:25,400
It's the power to keep our hopes alive in you.

242
00:13:25,400 --> 00:13:26,400
You're not ghosts.

243
00:13:26,400 --> 00:13:27,400
You're not ghosts.

244
00:13:27,400 --> 00:13:29,400
I'm the magic I used to have before I died.

245
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:30,400
I've been a part of you since then.

246
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:33,400
I had no idea that when any of my friends died,

247
00:13:33,400 --> 00:13:37,400
I had the power to collect their magic like some kind of prize.

248
00:13:37,400 --> 00:13:39,400
What a disgusting ability.

249
00:13:39,400 --> 00:13:41,400
I'm so sorry.

250
00:13:41,400 --> 00:13:44,400
You don't have to be sorry about a thing.

251
00:13:44,400 --> 00:13:50,400
It's not about collecting magic like you're gobbling up more power for yourself or something.

252
00:13:50,400 --> 00:13:53,400
It's the power to keep our hopes alive in you.

253
00:13:53,400 --> 00:13:56,400
I'm keeping your hopes alive in me?

254
00:13:56,400 --> 00:13:58,400
That's right.

255
00:13:58,400 --> 00:14:03,400
And as long as you live, our hopes will continue to live on too.

256
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,400
Yep.

257
00:14:04,400 --> 00:14:07,400
That'll be rough sometimes, lugging our hopes around with you,

258
00:14:07,400 --> 00:14:09,400
but we appreciate it.

259
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:12,400
You're more than capable of carrying your own hope.

260
00:14:16,400 --> 00:14:19,400
Mifuyu, when you finally leave the wings of the Magius,

261
00:14:19,400 --> 00:14:22,400
would you like to move back to Mikazuki Villa?

262
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:25,400
Are you serious?

263
00:14:25,400 --> 00:14:27,400
Yes, I am.

264
00:14:27,400 --> 00:14:29,400
I'd love to.

265
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:30,400
I'll take the living room then.

266
00:14:30,400 --> 00:14:32,400
I think I'll be happy there.

267
00:14:32,400 --> 00:14:34,400
Plus, I can keep my eye on everyone.

268
00:14:34,400 --> 00:14:36,400
I'll take the living room too.

